a cash fee equal to 7% of the aggregate gross proceeds raised in this offering. We have also agreed to pay the Placement Agent a non-accountable
expense allowance equal to 1% of the gross proceeds. The Placement Agent will also be reimbursed for certain out-of-pocket accountable
