    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Offering Price of the Common shares and Pre-Funded Warrants:</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The purchase price of each Common Share is $8.27. The purchase price of each Pre-funded Warrant is $8.269, which equals the price per Common Share being sold to the public in this offering, minus $0.001. The Pre-funded Warrants will be exercisable immediately and will expire five (5) years from the date of issuance.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
