    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The shares are traded on Nasdaq under the symbol &ldquo;GDC.&rdquo; Our Pre-funded Warrants are not and will not be listed on any stock exchange.</FONT></TD></TR>
