<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following table summarizes as of December 31, 2022, on a pro forma basis, as described above, the number of shares of our common stock,
the total consideration and the average price per share (1)&nbsp;paid to us by our existing stockholders and (2)&nbsp;issued to persons
