    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Ms. Yimin Jin was appointed as the Co-CEO of the Company on April 15, 2019. Mr. Jin is also a director of the Company. The amounts reflect the compensation Mr. Jin received for his services as the Co-CEO and a director of the Company.</FONT></TD></TR>
