    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Mr. Wei Xu was appointed as the President of the Company on October 29, 2020. Mr. Xu is also a director of the Company. The amounts reflect the compensation Mr. Xu received for his services as the President and a director of the Company.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; background-color: white; border-collapse: collapse">
