    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">(3)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Mr. Yuguo Zhang was appointed as the President and a director of the Company on April 25, 2019. Mr. Zhang resigned as a director on February 25, 2020 and resigned as the President on October 29, 2020. The amounts reflect the compensation Mr. Zhang received for his services as the President and a director of the Company.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
